229
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:56,889
Kumpulkan seberapa banyak Candy,

230
00:16:56,890 --> 00:17:02,200
lalu dapatkan barang idaman
sebelum pemain lain, pon.

231
00:17:03,020 --> 00:17:08,219
Alangkah baik jika perebutan barang
boleh diselesaikan secara aman, pon.

232
00:17:08,220 --> 00:17:10,640
Baru sekarang mahu cakap begitu.

233
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:16,409
Osom, pon!

234
00:17:16,410 --> 00:17:19,099
Sekali lagi, pon!

235
00:17:19,100 --> 00:17:21,419
Alah, saya kalah!

236
00:17:21,420 --> 00:17:22,700
Maaf, ya.

237
00:17:23,050 --> 00:17:24,819
Sayang sungguh.

238
00:17:24,820 --> 00:17:27,129
Padahal Nokkochan mampu
bertahan agak lama.

239
00:17:27,130 --> 00:17:28,699
Hendak buat macam mana.

240
00:17:28,700 --> 00:17:31,820
Awak diterima masuk
ke party Bell-san, ya.

241
00:17:33,410 --> 00:17:36,580
Kerana cuma saya yang tinggal...

242
00:17:37,220 --> 00:17:38,840
Begitu rupanya.

243
00:17:39,580 --> 00:17:41,579
Betul juga.

244
00:17:41,580 --> 00:17:46,390
Walaupun dia nampak tenang,
pasti perit baginya.

245
00:17:47,340 --> 00:17:48,969
Hebatnya.

246
00:17:48,970 --> 00:17:51,830
Mudah sungguh awak menang
adu osom tadi.

247
00:17:52,180 --> 00:17:53,689
Kebetulan sahaja.

248
00:17:53,690 --> 00:17:55,660
Boleh saya tanya satu perkara?

249
00:17:56,060 --> 00:17:57,360
Tentang apa?

250
00:17:57,740 --> 00:17:59,859
Saya tanya terus terang, ya.

251
00:17:59,860 --> 00:18:01,649
Apa yang berlaku antara kamu berdua?

252
00:18:01,650 --> 00:18:04,839
Saya dan Shadow Gale berbeza pendapat,

253
00:18:04,840 --> 00:18:07,409
jadi kami memilih untuk berpisah haluan.

254
00:18:07,410 --> 00:18:09,170
Maaf atas kesulitan ini.

255
00:18:09,560 --> 00:18:13,170
Kalau itu sebabnya,
kami tidak kisah...

256
00:18:13,460 --> 00:18:16,659
Setakat ini sahaja acara kali ini, pon.

257
00:18:16,660 --> 00:18:18,870
Tiba masanya log out, pon.

258
00:18:48,930 --> 00:18:53,550
Saya sentiasa dalam rupa Gadis Sihir.

259
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:55,760
Sebabnya ialah...

260
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:00,890
Hati-hati, Noriko-chan.

261
00:19:01,700 --> 00:19:03,030
Saya pergi dulu.

262
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:05,369
Dengan sihir,

263
00:19:05,370 --> 00:19:09,179
budak yang tinggal sendirian tak akan
dianggap pelik oleh sesiapa pun.

264
00:19:09,180 --> 00:19:10,889
Sebab itulah...

265
00:19:10,890 --> 00:19:13,379
(Sekolah Rendah 3 Manabegawa)

266
00:19:13,380 --> 00:19:14,219
(Kelas 4-2)

267
00:19:14,220 --> 00:19:18,479
Semasa pesta kebudayaan semalam,
kelas kita dikatakan yang terbaik.

268
00:19:18,480 --> 00:19:20,529
Cikgu pun berasa gembira.

269
00:19:20,530 --> 00:19:24,289
Itu kerana Cikgu Noguchi
turut membantu kami.

270
00:19:24,290 --> 00:19:27,680
Kelas saya, Kelas 4-2, kelas yang baik.

271
00:19:28,270 --> 00:19:31,609
Semua orang berusaha keras
dan bergembira bersama.

272
00:19:31,610 --> 00:19:34,279
Sudah tentu tiada yang membuli.

273
00:19:34,280 --> 00:19:37,339
Mari kita berusaha bersama lagi
semasa temasya sukan nanti.

274
00:19:37,340 --> 00:19:39,260
Baik!

275
00:19:40,290 --> 00:19:45,729
Guru kelas kami, Cikgu Noguchi,
dulunya kerap menengking murid.

276
00:19:45,730 --> 00:19:48,230
Namun, sekarang cikgu tidak pernah
menengking lagi.

277
00:19:49,460 --> 00:19:51,739
Suasana kelas sangat ceria
dan mendamaikan.

278
00:19:51,740 --> 00:19:56,679
Lagipun, tiada siapa yang kisah
walaupun saya kekal dalam rupa ini.

279
00:19:56,680 --> 00:20:00,680
(Kelas 4-2)

280
00:20:02,690 --> 00:20:04,859
Saya yang dapat dulu!

281
00:20:04,860 --> 00:20:06,940
Pulangkan balik!

282
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:10,449
Apa awak merepek?!
Saya yang dapat dulu, tahu!

283
00:20:10,450 --> 00:20:12,639
Tadi awak sudah main!

284
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:14,519
Awak asyik nak main seorang diri!

285
00:20:14,520 --> 00:20:16,019
Diamlah!

286
00:20:16,020 --> 00:20:17,620
Lepaskanlah!

287
00:20:21,330 --> 00:20:23,269
Tak mengapa, saya main nanti saja.

288
00:20:23,270 --> 00:20:25,900
Lagipun, awak yang dapat dulu tadi.

289
00:20:26,320 --> 00:20:27,440
Maafkan saya, ya.

290
00:20:30,120 --> 00:20:32,319
Apabila ada yang berasa marah,

291
00:20:32,320 --> 00:20:35,169
saya gandakan rasa gembira mereka.

292
00:20:35,170 --> 00:20:36,379
(Khusus Pejalan Kaki dan Basikal)

293
00:20:36,380 --> 00:20:38,219
Apabila ada yang berasa sedih,

294
00:20:38,220 --> 00:20:40,600
saya redakan kesedihan mereka.

295
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:44,099
Kerana itulah sihir saya.

296
00:20:44,100 --> 00:20:45,809
(Hospital Umum Ishikawa)

297
00:20:45,810 --> 00:20:47,599
Wah, hari ini datang lagi?

298
00:20:47,600 --> 00:20:49,049
Rajin sungguh.

299
00:20:49,050 --> 00:20:51,860
Ya, terima kasih sudah jaga ibu saya.

300
00:20:53,860 --> 00:20:55,220
Ibu.

301
00:20:55,870 --> 00:20:57,219
Saya dah sampai.

302
00:20:57,220 --> 00:20:59,359
Selamat datang, Noriko.

303
00:20:59,360 --> 00:21:00,839
Maaf buat kamu datang setiap hari.

304
00:21:00,840 --> 00:21:03,380
Tak apa, saya tak kisah.

305
00:21:04,330 --> 00:21:09,380
Semasa pesta kebudayaan semalam,
cikgu kata kelas kami paling hebat.

306
00:21:10,040 --> 00:21:13,460
Maaf ibu tidak dapat datang.

307
00:21:16,520 --> 00:21:18,740
Tidak mengapa.

308
00:21:28,970 --> 00:21:32,099
Lagipun, ibu sudah tengok
banyak gambar kamu.

309
00:21:32,100 --> 00:21:33,140
Ya.

310
00:21:36,540 --> 00:21:39,279
Ibu tidak berkata apa-apa.

311
00:21:39,280 --> 00:21:41,149
Kos hospital ibu sangat mahal,

312
00:21:41,150 --> 00:21:43,160
kami tak mampu bayar pembedahan itu.

313
00:21:43,840 --> 00:21:45,739
Dengan sihir yang saya ada,

314
00:21:45,740 --> 00:21:49,750
saya cuma dapat ceriakan hati ibu.

315
00:21:55,380 --> 00:21:56,699
Begitu rupanya.

316
00:21:56,700 --> 00:22:00,910
Nampaknya ganjaran penyelesaian
dibahagi sama rata antara pemain.

317
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:06,430
Baiklah, lebih baik saya tukar baju
dan lipat kain jemuran.

318
00:23:40,020 --> 00:23:49,980
(Episod Seterusnya)
(Mimpi Lazuline)

